							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">basically one of our acquaintances was walkin across the street and he like tapped the hood of a Dodge Charger.not even like hard..just a couple taps.&nbsp; a cop gets out the car and is like &quot;dont fuckin touch my car...blah blah&quot;. so the guy was like yo i didnt kno it was a police car. i saw the cop like grab the dude over to the sidewalk and start gettin in his face. Ra was tellin me that the cop was sayin &quot;im gonna take u to jail!&quot; and the dude was like &quot;take me to jail then, u have nothing against me...theres no law sayin that i cant touch a cop car&quot; somethin like that. Then i saw Ra talkin to the cop...i dont know what Ra said tho. so after that, we left to go find a place to eat...after we were done eating and bout to go back home..we stopped for some gas...and the cop was just posted in the parking lot in his Charger waitin for ppl! maybe it was coincidence...but yeah</div>
