							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Where do I begin?<br /><br />First, &quot;to be attacked by the enemy is a good thing; it means you&#039;re effective&quot; (Mao). Second, discussions like this are scary to people; especially if they know they might be called upon to actually get off their ass and act.<br /><br />One thing we can call a small &quot;v&quot; victory is that the FBI&#039;s actions towards Freedom are getting alot of press. That&#039;s a start. <br /><br />I&#039;m also noticing that the other emcees/crews that are generally &#039;non-political&#039; are starting to show that side of themselves. And those that are &#039;political&#039; are starting to show that part of themselves outside of music; DV One&#039;s Seaspot photo shoot was an example of this.<br /><br />Political consciousness is a process. Have faith in the process.<br /><br />Greg</div>
